    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or fatigue; weight up a little as planned</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vision change</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dry mouth or sore throat</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea or diarrhea</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular periods; no increased thirst or urination; no discharge or pelvic pain</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heat or cold intolerance; no breast discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No stress pain in the feet or shins</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No acne flare or rash on lithium</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>Faint fine tremor only when tired; no restlessness or stiffness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; PHQ-9 score 3; no racing thoughts, voices, or thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

